WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:07.280
has ordered its gigantic robots, Garabakas 7 and Douglas L2,

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.280
the destruction of Tokyo.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:23.310
He tries to get Japan,

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:28.020
a unique source of the known type and available in the world of light-energy-based strength,

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:30.000
and to get it, he tries to conquer

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
the Institute for Energy Research.

00:00:34.390 --> 00:00:42.240
Meanwhile, Mazinger Z,

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.100
the magnificent and powerful robot created by Dr. Kabuto

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:49.100
to stop Dr. Hell in his diabolical plan,

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.800
is facing some problems.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.000
Yerceta and Aphrodite...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.540
They are similar, Sayaka.

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:06.310
Use the same technique as with Aphrodite A, Sayaka, and you will be able to control it.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:10.350
Understood, throw the center lever backwards, to stabilize it.

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:13.150
The one in the center? Well, I already have it.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:30.000
The left one, and also try to move the pedal.

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:04.280
- A very powerful robot. - I didn't know that.

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:07.190
I don't want excuses!

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:13.390
Professor Kabuto did it to stop the Semicolons and I want it to be destroyed immediately!

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:16.110
I understand, Dr. Gell.

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:21.890
Hurry up to Mount Fuji to destroy Mazinger Z.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.000
This is the great Mazinger.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.640
It's huge!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:07.330
That's Fielder 1, from him you can control Mazinger Z.

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:13.030
Magnificent, I think it's great!

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:20.520
Brother, you're something very special!

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:23.170
You think so? Well, let's go!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:28.350
Well, my name is Koji Kabuto.

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.000
And I'm his brother, Shiro.

00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:35.260
I'm Dr. Yumi, Professor Kabuto's student. This is my daughter Sayaka.

00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.530
It's a pleasure.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:38.800
Thank you for helping me with Mazinger.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:41.800
Without her, you wouldn't have been able to help that monster!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.600
No one has asked for your opinion, intruder!

00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:46.570
Don't yell at me like that in front of the people!

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:48.400
Don't provoke me!

00:04:48.400 --> 00:04:57.680
Enough, guys. Tell me how Professor Kabuto is. I haven't seen him in a while, and I really miss him.

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:19.020
I'm very sorry for the professor's death.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.680
He was a good friend.

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:27.060
Doctor Hell, what kind of person is he?

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.000
I don't know Sayaka, but it seems that he wants to...

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:36.260
conquer the whole world. But how do you intend to do that? Professor Yumi, my grandfather

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:50.690
left this to die. Oh, it's the testament of the professor. Testamento? It was many years ago, along with

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:58.200
other scientists and archaeologists from all over the world, I discovered the ancient island of Rhodes in the Aegean Sea.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:10.380
The research committee was led by Dr. Hell

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:12.550
Splendid, these ruins are magnificent

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:14.550
Doctor, these are the Mikenese ruins

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:17.160
Then the myth of the Mikenese is true

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:18.160
Look at this giant

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:21.180
It's huge

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:25.040
The Mikenese robot is a wonder of the world

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.540
You're right, Dr. Kabuto

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:30.000
Centuries ago, the island of Rhodes was under the control of

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:39.870
The Mycenaeans, there were invaders who came in search of them, but they were always rejected by these magnificent robots.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:59.510
Powerful Mycenaeans could destroy their enemies, but they could not against nature, destroyed by the earthquake that struck the Aegean Sea.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:07.120
We have made the discovery of the century, we will take advantage of the magnificent legacy of the Mikenese.

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:17.480
While we were rebuilding the robots, Dr. Hell prepared his diabolical plan that none of us had the slightest suspicion.

00:07:17.480 --> 00:07:25.280
Attention everyone! Thank you for your help in the reconstruction of the Mikenese robot.

00:07:25.280 --> 00:07:30.000
While you were doing your job, I put a telepathic control on it.

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:35.440
The powerful machines will only move at my will and command.

00:07:35.440 --> 00:07:44.800
Dr. Hell, I no longer need you.

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:48.300
With my new mechanical army, I will conquer the world.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.040
You can die here.

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:37.330
I was lucky enough to escape from the Dr. Hell.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:46.150
I returned to Japan and dedicated myself to the development of light energy to destroy the Dr. Hell.

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:48.860
Now I understand why he did it.

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.680
What do you mean, Professor Yumi?

00:08:50.680 --> 00:08:53.560
Dad, tell us what you think.

00:08:53.560 --> 00:08:57.380
Now I understand why the professor left the institute and retired.

00:08:57.380 --> 00:09:00.000
I planned to use the Japanese for peaceful purposes.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.400
...as the professor wished, that's why I built this robot.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:09.800
Aphrodite A, this robot wasn't designed to carry weapons.

00:09:11.430 --> 00:09:16.930
But the retired professor built a powerful war machine, the Mazinger Z...

00:09:17.250 --> 00:09:19.250
...to fight Dr. Hell.

00:09:20.430 --> 00:09:22.730
And you, Koji, you have to drive the robot.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:24.790
I understand, doctor.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:30.000
But the first thing you have to do is learn to drive all the controls well.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.370
I'll learn it right away, it's easy.

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:34.320
You'll see.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:36.650
Are you sure about that?

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:43.420
I know you have more experience than me, and I hope you'll teach me Sayaka.

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:45.300
If you let me.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:50.920
It seems to me that you will need a lot of help from Mazinger Koji.

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:54.040
No one has asked for your opinion, Chiru.

00:09:54.040 --> 00:09:58.150
I need a lot of help from Koji, and nothing less than from a girl.

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.000
Oh, my God!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:03.120
Something terrible is happening.

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:04.280
What is it?

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:21.060
The precious monsters of Dr. Hell.

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:23.780
That means that your plan has already begun.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.180
We can't stay here.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:29.390
We have to attack them with Mazinger Z, as Grandpa said.

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:30.000
Agreed.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.000
I can, Koji, but you are not ready yet. You need much more practice.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.000
Professor, there is no time for that now.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.000
Those monsters will destroy Japan if we don't stop them immediately.

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.850
We must take action right now.

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:44.830
That's right, Koji. Go with everything you have.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.830
I'll take care of things here.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.830
Be careful, Shiro. Be very careful.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:52.440
Wait for me!

00:11:01.150 --> 00:11:03.590
Do a roundup, try to do things right!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:09.830
It doesn't matter, the robot Professor Kabuto made is so good that Koki can't handle it correctly.

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:10.980
What?

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:18.850
Hold on a minute, Koki! Wait, it's almost solo, let me help you!

00:11:18.850 --> 00:11:22.650
I know how to direct it! Yahoo!

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:30.000
Hahaha, look at that, Garada K-7 Douglas M-2, an ignorant human trying to

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:34.200
to lead Mazinger Z to destroy it!

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:22.330
Ayaka, it will be better if you wait for me!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:24.810
I can go with you, Kogui!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:27.050
You don't have weapons in Aphrodite A!

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:28.690
You're going to fight with them!

00:12:28.690 --> 00:12:29.570
But I...

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:35.710
Besides, the truth is that you would be on my way if you come with me.

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:41.270
Yes, Koji, you talk a lot, but how are you going to fight if you don't even know how to handle Mazinger Z?

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:50.590
Don't worry, I'm going to beat them!

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:54.220
And I just hit them hard!

00:12:54.220 --> 00:13:00.000
Shiro, is it possible that you don't realize that Koji's life is in danger?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:05.510
The mechanics attack!

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.780
That's it, that's it! I've got it!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:39.780
That gave a very good result!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.920
I don't give a shit about my monsters!

00:14:32.040 --> 00:14:34.040
Mazinger Z is finished!

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:49.310
You're not finished, Koji!

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:50.230
Get up!

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:54.240
You have to get up and face Dr. Hell even when you're hurt!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.160
You can't stay there!

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.020
Remember your mission!

00:14:58.020 --> 00:15:00.000
I'm counting on you, Koji!

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:02.040
Those monsters!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:03.710
Grandpa!

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.800
Oh!

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.970
I got you! Get up!

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.300
Listen to me, Tayarca!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:19.820
- Did you see that, Baron Aschler? - How is it that Mazinger Z did not burn?

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:25.720
Mazinger Z is built with a special alloy discovered by Dr. Kabuto.

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:30.000
- That damn professor! - We cannot defeat Mazinger Z.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:47.960
Mr. Z with fire will be for other means, Garada K7 destroys!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.900
Mazinger could be a saint or a devil.

00:18:22.900 --> 00:18:27.970
It can be diabolical if it is used for evil.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:30.000
But I swear that only if you

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:35.640
in favor of justice and to destroy Dr. Hell and its diabolical dream.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:49.450
Dr. Hell! Dr. Hell!

00:18:49.450 --> 00:18:55.050
I'm your robot if you allow me. Just give me more time.

00:18:55.050 --> 00:19:00.000
No, it's a waste of time, Baron Axler. Mazinger Z is more powerful

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:06.470
of what we thought, we must look for stronger weapons to destroy him, but we will do it.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.120
Sayaka, tell me, child, do you feel bad?

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:12.420
Dad, why am I here?

00:20:12.420 --> 00:20:16.540
Koji, you helped me. Thank you, Koji.

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:19.020
Oh, it really was nothing, Sayaka.

00:20:19.020 --> 00:20:23.040
If you had seen how he beat those fruits by himself!

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.110
Look how he gets red!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.710
I told you not to get involved in my things!

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:29.330
They haven't changed.

00:20:32.810 --> 00:20:38.100
- Tell me? - Yes, Research Institute. Turn on the TV, Cojín.

00:20:38.100 --> 00:20:43.190
I am Dr. Hell, and this is a warning.

00:20:43.190 --> 00:20:48.690
I declare to the world that I will destroy Japan and take over all of Japan.

00:20:48.690 --> 00:20:53.690
The only source of light energy in the world, I assure you.

00:20:53.690 --> 00:20:58.620
After that energy is in my control, nothing will be against my army.

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:00.000
I will conquer the world.

